}

</style>
</head>
<body class="theme-claude">
<article class="md-content">
<header class="md-header"><h1>Kitchen Sink</h1></header>
<h1 id="kitchen-sink" tabindex="-1">Kitchen Sink</h1>
<p>A paragraph with <strong>bold</strong>, <em>italic</em>, <code>inline code</code>, and a <a href="https://example.com">link</a>.</p>
<h2 id="lists" tabindex="-1">Lists</h2>
<ul>
<li>one</li>
